entropy is capability
entropy purpose "Authority to read random numbers from the operating system"
entropy grants read random.entropy none

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect read random.entropy
main effect write console.stdout
main uses entropy
main uses stdoutWriter
main memoryHeap true
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label step1 loopKind none
main label step1 within none
main label step2 loopKind none
main label step2 within none
main label step3 loopKind none
main label step3 within none
main label step4 loopKind none
main label step4 within none
main label failed loopKind none
main label failed within none
main let seed Int64 42 immutable
main let one Int64 1 immutable
main let six Int64 6 immutable
main let hundred Int64 100 immutable
main let emptyRangeText String "emptyRange" immutable
main let okCode ExitCode 0 immutable
main let failCode ExitCode 1 immutable
main at begin do firstGenerator
main at begin do secondGenerator
main at begin do drawFirst
main at begin branch ifError drawFirst goto failed else goto step1
main at step1 do drawSecond
main at step1 branch ifError drawSecond goto failed else goto step2
main at step2 do sameDraw
main at step2 do printRepeatable
main at step2 do rollDie
main at step2 branch ifError rollDie goto failed else goto step3
main at step3 do atLeastOne
main at step3 do atMostSix
main at step3 do printAboveLow
main at step3 do printBelowHigh
main at step3 do emptyDraw
main at step3 branch ifError emptyDraw goto step4 else goto failed
main at step4 do printEmptyRange
main at step4 return ok okCode
main at failed return ok failCode

store is region
store in main
store strategy arena
store maxBytes 65536
store released atReturn

